Package: gompertzMortality
Title: Reproducible Analysis of United States Adult Mortality
Version: 1.0.0
Authors@R: person("Jared", "Tanner", role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Downloads official NCHS life tables, estimates and compares adult
    mortality models, evaluates age-window sensitivity, studies demographic and
    state variation, and decomposes changes by underlying cause of death.
License: MIT + file LICENSE
Encoding: UTF-8
Depends: R (>= 4.3.0)
